1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,360
He Jingchen.

17
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,080
So much for being in this together.

18
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,040
What if he gives me a younger brother?

19
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,880
Would I ever get the treasure map?

20
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,680
Just do your part.

21
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,480
Don't worry.

22
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,160
There won't be a younger brother.

23
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,440
Or a younger sister.

24
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:09,140
=Episode 4=

25
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,200
What were you thinking?

26
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,600
How dare you tell such a massive lie?

27
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,640
If Iron Leopard finds out,

28
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,480
you'll die.

29
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,960
If I'm going to die,

30
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,480
will you save me?

31
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:45,760
Get ready.

32
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,200
In three days,

33
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,720
I'll get you out of
the Governor's Residence.

34
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:53,120
That's not the kind of saving I meant.

35
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,240
What else do you want?

36
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,600
You know how those concubines died.

37
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,800
Don't you?

38
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:01,600
Leaving the Governor's Residence
is your only option.

39
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,840
It's time to return this
to its rightful owner.

40
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,000
As long as you're here,

41
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,680
I'm not going anywhere.

42
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,720
Something at the Governor's Residence

43
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,280
tempts you.

44
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:40,080
Naturally, something here tempts me too.

45
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,160
If you stay,

46
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,920
even I won't be able to save you.

47
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:55,160
Who says you can't?

48
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,520
Just give me a child. That'll do.

49
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,480
Impossible.

50
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:09,000
Weren't you the one who swore
you'd keep me safe?

51
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:11,520
On your second day here,

52
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,160
I told you I'd send you away.

53
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,680
You refused.

54
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,760
You chose to stay in this awful place.

55
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,800
Everything here will be yours someday.

56
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:29,200
Why should I leave?

57
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:32,000
I want to stay and see it happen.

58
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,880
You've misunderstood.

59
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,720
I'm not as ambitious as you think.

60
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:43,080
You may fool the old man,

61
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,600
but you can't fool me.

62
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,480
Jingchen.

63
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,640
Give me a child.

64
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,280
I can fool everyone.

65
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,000
Once you succeed,

66
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,240
the three of us can be a family...

67
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,560
Impossible.

68
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,120
Why not?

69
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:26,360
Looks like there are more of us
in this together than I thought.

70
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,000
She has nothing to do with our plan.

71
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,280
She heard about our plan.

72
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,000
Jingchen.

73
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,800
We can't let her live.

74
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,120
Don't worry.

75
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,080
I work for him too.

76
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,520
We're on the same side.

77
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:37,840
The same side.

78
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,600
I washed your clothes for you.

79
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,440
Jingchen, you...

80
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,120
It's not what you think.

81
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,440
Let go of me!

82
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,720
Where are you taking me?

83
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,400
I knew it.

84
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,280
There's clearly something going on
between Jingchen and that girl.

85
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,400
My instincts are never wrong.

86
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,720
That girl can't be
the governor's daughter.

87
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,800
Look into it.

88
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:14,600
Yes.

89
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,200
He Jingchen!

90
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,120
He Jingchen, where are you taking me?

91
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,480
Let go of me!

92
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,480
Look.

93
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,160
Look at who they were.

94
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,240
If you want to stay alive,

95
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:39,040
stay away from Iron Leopard's women.

96
00:05:39,060 --> 00:05:41,820
(Eleventh Concubine Zhou's Tablet
Twelfth Concubine Yue'e's Tablet)

97
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,680
If you breathe a word

98
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:46,640
about today to Iron Leopard,

99
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,480
I promise

100
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,240
you'll meet an even worse end.

101
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,640
Even the women in Iron Leopard's bed

102
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:55,000
were planted by you?

103
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,240
(If that's what she thinks,)

104
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,880
(all the better.)

105
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,680
Why did you kill them?

106
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:04,800
They disobeyed us.

107
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,080
So they had to be replaced.

108
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:10,960
So if Lady Feng disobeys you,

109
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,200
will she die too?

110
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,440
Of course.

111
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:36,440
(If you breathe a word to Iron Leopard,)

112
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,160
(I promise)

113
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,680
(you'll meet an even worse end.)

114
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:45,360
(He Jingchen and Lu Shaoyun)

115
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,840
(are wolves who'd eat me alive.)

116
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,320
(They disobeyed us.)

117
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,920
(So they had to be replaced.)

118
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,680
(Su Yutang,)

119
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:59,080
(stay alert until you've had
your revenge.)

120
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,600
(Don't end up dead at their hands.)

121
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,680
(Lu)
Don't blame yourself.

122
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:06,400
You weren't responsible for the death
of the second concubine's daughter.

123
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,840
But the plan was my idea.

124
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,760
You mean

125
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:14,360
keep Iron Leopard's real daughter
from reuniting with him

126
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,560
and find someone to take her place?

127
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,600
Yes.

128
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,760
An impostor's easier to control

129
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,960
when we have leverage over them.

130
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,200
As for the real one,

131
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:25,040
she should never appear
at the Governor's Residence.

132
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,480
I had planned

133
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,680
to find the second concubine's daughter

134
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:36,680
and send her far away.

135
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,160
I never expected...

136
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:43,080
Lu Shaoyun to find her first

137
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,680
and kill her.

138
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:49,440
Though Mother and the second concubine
were mistress and servant,

139
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,680
they bonded right away

140
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:52,640
and became like sisters.

141
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,840
I wonder if Mother blames me
from heaven.

142
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,200
She wouldn't.

143
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:02,520
If your mother hadn't risked her life

144
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:05,840
to cover their escape
from the Governor's Residence,

145
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,960
they'd both have died long ago.

146
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:11,280
Now history is repeating itself.

147
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:14,560
We can only do what we know is right.

148
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:22,040
Has that girl been coming here
to practice shooting?

149
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,600
Yes.

150
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,040
She always asks Zhaolin for pointers.

151
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,840
(Lu Zhentian is bloodthirsty and cruel.)

152
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,640
(He Jingchen prowls like a hungry wolf.)

153
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,440
(Danger lurks everywhere
in the Governor's Residence.)

154
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:36,600
(Since it's unwise to act rashly
against Lu Shaoyun right now,)

155
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,880
(I might as well use this identity)

156
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,880
(to make myself stronger)

157
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,440
(and wait for my chance.)

158
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,120
You told her to win Iron Leopard over,

159
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,840
but isn't she trying a little too hard?

160
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:57,360
What's wrong with that?

161
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:03,160
Are you sure she's only trying
to rise in status,

162
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:05,880
not avenge the second concubine's
daughter?

163
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,800
If it's the former,

164
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,080
the harder she works,

165
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:13,600
the more useful she'll be to us.

166
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,680
If it's the latter,

167
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,240
then one day she'll be on our side.

168
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,120
So what's there to worry about?

169
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:33,520
That's right.

170
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:34,800
It belonged to Lin Kefu.

171
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,080
It's been a long time.

172
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,560
Are you sure you remember it correctly?

173
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,160
I'm sure.

174
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,720
(Shuanglong Alley)
If it weren't for that jade pendant,

175
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,520
I wouldn't have been thrown
out of the troupe.

176
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,400
Back then,

177
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:47,120
I saw how much Lin Kefu treasured it,

178
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,560
so I stole it and pawned it.

179
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,800
When she found out,

180
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,480
she was frantic.

181
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,480
The pawnshop hiked the price,

182
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,280
so Lin Kefu spent all her savings

183
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,800
and borrowed money
from the troupe master

184
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,760
to get it back.

185
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,360
What about Su Yutang?

186
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:03,360
How did she react?

187
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,200
She panicked too.

188
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,760
She helped Lin Kefu raise the money,

189
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,040
but wasn't as frantic as Lin Kefu.

190
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:12,100
(Shuanglong Alley)

191
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,520
Take this for now.

192
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:16,920
Later, tell the governor
the same story,

193
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,360
and I'll reward you generously.

194
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,000
(Shuanglong Alley)

195
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,920
Thank you, Madam.

196
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,480
You're truly my savior.

197
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,440
May you live a long life.

198
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:46,930
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

199
00:10:48,590 --> 00:10:51,930
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

200
00:10:51,930 --> 00:10:54,550
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

201
00:10:56,070 --> 00:10:57,630
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

202
00:10:57,630 --> 00:11:01,750
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

203
00:11:02,310 --> 00:11:07,710
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

204
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:12,630
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

205
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:15,990
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

206
00:11:15,990 --> 00:11:18,550
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

207
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:21,550
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

208
00:11:21,830 --> 00:11:28,070
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

209
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:31,870
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

210
00:11:31,870 --> 00:11:35,110
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

211
00:11:35,110 --> 00:11:41,870
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

212
00:11:41,870 --> 00:11:45,150
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

213
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:48,590
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

214
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:50,710
♪Boundless♪
